# The scraper/harvester is a local data-ingestion toolchain, NOT part of the
# deployed static site. Track its SOURCE (scripts + hand-maintained configs) so the
# pipeline is reproducible, but keep heavy/generated artifacts out of the repo — only
# the built data under data/ is published.
scraper/node_modules/
scraper/.native/
scraper/output/
scraper/artifacts/
# generated per-run by make_shard_config.js
scraper/harvest.shard*.json
# debug screenshots / scratch
scraper/*.png
scraper/discover_servicearea.html
scraper/savi_output.csv

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.log
*.swp
Thumbs.db

# Scraper/debug screenshots — not part of the deployed app
artifacts/

# Plan / scratch
.claude/
